              "value": "Trigger: A creature scores a critical hit on the mukradi.\n\nThe mukradi's Breath Weapon recharges. It can use its Breath Weapon immediately as part of this reaction. It can't use this reaction again until it recharges its Breath Weapon naturally."
            },
